  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag645" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?--&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;1.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;General&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are a Delaware limited liability company, formed on August 9, 1999. When we refer to "us," "we," "our," "the Company," or "Horizon" we are describing Horizon Pipeline Company, L.L.C.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Members' interests in Horizon are as follows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 36pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 50% - Natural Gas Pipeline Company of America LLC (NGPL), an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of NGPL Holdings LLC (NGPL Holdings), which is indirectly owned 62.5% by funds managed by ArcLight Capital Partners, LLC and 37.5% by Kinder Morgan, Inc.; and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 36pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 50% - Nicor Horizon, Inc., an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of The Southern Company.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have prepared our accompanying financial statements in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America. In management&amp;#8217;s opinion, these financial statements reflect normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of our financial results for the interim periods presented, and adequate disclosures have been made to make the information presented not misleading. These interim financial statements should be read along with the financial statements and related notes included in our 2025 Annual Report of Non-Major Natural Gas Companies on Form No. 2-A (Form No. 2-A).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Management has evaluated subsequent events through May 29, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2. Debt&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The following table summarizes the net carrying value of our outstanding debt (in thousands):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
